top_reviews_walmart:
{"negative":{"rating":1,"review":"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This product was a miss for me unfortunately . It was not creamy and buttery tasting, nor was it easy to spread despite it being the spreadable version. It was difficult to get the product out with a knife and get it to spread on toast which is not something that I've seen when using other butter brands. The taste was not as creamy and pleasant tasting as other butters I've had."},"positive":{"rating":5,"review":"These eggs are as close as you can get to having your own backyard hens.

The yolks are bright yellow, because they are truly free ranged on acres and acres of natural grasses. Never caged.

Vital Farms includes a link to the videos where you can see the lives these hens lead."}}
